  "rationale": "Setting skip_trimming to true bypasses TRIMGALORE and FQ_LINT_AFTER_TRIMMING, forwarding the pre-trimming reads directly to BBSplit while preserving initial FastQC, concatenation, raw-read linting, reference preparation and reference-dependent transcript-to-gene mapping. Changed read inputs propagate through contaminant filtering, strandedness inference, alignment, quantification, post-alignment quality control, coverage generation and reporting, with MultiQC additionally losing the trimming reports. This static prediction assumes that the altered reads continue to satisfy downstream sample-selection conditions, which have not been verified through execution."
